Qwen2.5-14B  & 5:1 & 384 & 0.47 & 1.56$\times$ & +7.9\%  & Diluted Spread & Boundary positive \\
Gemma-2-9B   & 2:1 & 336 & 0.23 & 1.47$\times$ & $-$0.35\% & Flat         & Negative \\
Yi-1.5-9B    & 8:1 & 192 & 0.71 & 1.08$\times$ & $\approx$0\% & Spike     & GQA counterexample \\
